  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Hailed as the Pure-White Princess, Princess Celine bears a dreadful curse. When she comes of age, her white hair will turn scarlet, and her kingdom will drown in blood. Resigned to her fate, she meaninglessly drifts through life until she meets the enigmatic yet gentle Duke Weinberg, who awakens her desire and rekindles her will to live. But as their bond deepens, so do her doubts. Who is he truly? What lies behind his love? And what will become of her kingdom that's bound to her cursed fate?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
